{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Kfw7gq4qLpaGxupNQ1b7Dr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed imagined experimental data for all \"planned\" experiments in the experiment_plan, under the \"median\" tier definition. Let me go through each planned experiment and generate expected results with rationales.\n\nLet me identify all planned experiments:\n- plan_006: Gradient conflict analysis on v7 (3 epoch checkpoints)\n- plan_007: Attention heatmap visualization\n- plan_008: Held-out eval (status: ANALYZING)\n- plan_009: Llama-3.1-8B Phase 1 GAR diagnosis\n\n\n- plan_010: Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate v7 training\n- plan_011: Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only training\n- plan_012: Llama-3.1-8B 3-way eval\n- plan_013: Llama-3.1-8B gradient conflict analysis\n- plan_014: Downstream task sanity check\n\nNow I'm working through the remaining experiments and establishing the median tier parameters—the Llama-3 direction holds but with reduced magnitude, the held-out eval gap tightens, and the core findings remain valid though the quantitative claims become more conservative.\n\nLooking at the metric ranges for the median tier across all these experiments, I'm setting bounds for the gradient alignment rates, training-inference gaps, gradient cosine similarities, and magnitude ratios that reflect this weakened but directionally consistent pattern.\n\nNow I'm cross-referencing the Qwen baseline data to ensure my parameter ranges align with what we've observed—the phase 1 drop of about 71%, the 30x training-inference gap, and the gradient dynamics showing both negative cosine similarity and significant magnitude ratio increases. I'm using these as anchors to calibrate the ranges for the remaining experiments, particularly for plan_006 which focuses on gradient conflict dynamics in the Qwen model.\n\nFor plan_006, I notice the gradient data with cosine similarity and magnitude ratios is already marked complete in the paper framing, but the plan itself lists it as pending—so I'm generating the full structured 3-checkpoint analysis to formalize what's been partially observed. Plan_007 needs attention heatmap visualizations showing how the model's focus shifts across different layers and tokens. For plan_008, I'm still determining what analysis is needed.\n\nNow looking at the held-out evaluation results where the magnitude gap compresses to 10-20x under median tier conditions, and the Llama experiments show directional consistency but reduced effect sizes. Plan_014 requires demonstrating that GAR correlates meaningfully with downstream task performance. I'm ready to assemble the complete YAML output.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17967,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17967},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c180130d-54f8-4b82-ad72-762224b8f1d7","uuid":"cf8d1acf-b182-4220-baa3-6a965246a30f"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Kfw7gq4qLpaGxupNQ1b7Dr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心 distribution shift insight 成立但需调整定量 claims 强度。\"30x gap\" 改为\n  \"10-30x gap depending on model and evaluation setting\"。跨模型结论从 \"identical\n  failure pattern\" 软化为 \"consistent failure direction with architecture-dependent\n  magnitude\"。Llama-3 gap 较小可归因于 GQA 注意力结构差异和不同 pretraining distribution，\n  这本身可成为额外 insight。Held-out eval gap 缩小需诚实报告并讨论 eval contamination\n  影响，同时强调即使 10x gap 仍远超实用阈值。标题从 \"Cannot Fix\" 软化为 \"Largely Fails to Fix\"。\n  Findings 评估 3.0-3.5 仍可行。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Gradient Conflict Analysis (Qwen v7, 3 checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      对 v7 训练的 3 个 epoch checkpoint (ep0/ep1/ep2) 计算每层 gate 参数上\n      NTP 与 GAR 梯度的 cos_sim 和 magnitude ratio，量化梯度竞争随训练演化的趋势。\n    expected_results:\n      # Epoch 0 checkpoint (训练初期，GAR loss 仍有信号)\n      ep0_conflict_layer_pct: 0.679      # 67.9% 层方向冲突 (cos_sim < 0)\n      ep0_mean_cos_sim: -0.089           # 平均余弦相似度，强方向冲突\n      ep0_median_mag_ratio: 7.5          # NTP 梯度幅度是 GAR 的 7.5x\n      ep0_L27_mag_ratio: 135.0           # 最后层 NTP 压制极端\n      # Epoch 1 checkpoint (GAR 已收敛，梯度信号衰减)\n      ep1_conflict_layer_pct: 0.714      # 71.4% 层仍冲突\n      ep1_mean_cos_sim: -0.063           # 冲突减弱——不是因为调和，而是 GAR 信号边缘化\n      ep1_median_mag_ratio: 11.2         # 幅度压制加剧\n      ep1_L27_mag_ratio: 487.0\n      # Epoch 2 checkpoint (训练末期)\n      ep2_conflict_layer_pct: 0.786      # 78.6% 层冲突（更多层 GAR 信号消失后暴露底层冲突）\n      ep2_mean_cos_sim: -0.042           # 方向冲突减弱 ← GAR 梯度幅度趋近零\n      ep2_median_mag_ratio: 14.7         # NTP 完全压制\n      ep2_L27_mag_ratio: 1139.0\n      # 关键层分析\n      early_layers_0_7_avg_cos_sim: -0.031    # 浅层冲突较弱\n      mid_layers_8_19_avg_cos_sim: -0.072     # 中间层冲突最强\n      late_layers_20_27_avg_cos_sim: -0.048   # 深层冲突中等但 mag_ratio 极高\n      gate_grad_norm_gar_ep0: 0.0034\n      gate_grad_norm_gar_ep2: 0.00028         # GAR 梯度范数下降 12x\n      gate_grad_norm_ntp_ep0: 0.025\n      gate_grad_norm_ntp_ep2: 0.0041          # NTP 梯度也下降但幅度小得多\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下此实验结果与 paper_framing 中已引用数据一致。核心发现是方向冲突\n      (cos_sim < 0) 随训练减弱不是因为两个 loss 目标调和了，而是 GAR 梯度幅度趋近零\n      导致冲突 \"消失\"。mag_ratio 从 7.5x 增长到 14.7x 证实 NTP 逐步完全压制 GAR。\n      中间层 (L8-L19) 冲突最强因为这些层是 attention pattern 形成的关键区域，GAR loss\n      试图在此干预但被 NTP 压制。L27 的极端 mag_ratio (135→1139) 反映最后一层 NTP\n      梯度因 cross-entropy softmax 特性天然最强。这些数据为 SP2 (NTP-GAR 梯度竞争)\n      提供完整的逐层、跨 epoch 量化证据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-layer gradient conflict across 3 epochs\"\n        columns: [\"Layer Group\", \"Metric\", \"Epoch 0\", \"Epoch 1\", \"Epoch 2\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0-L7 (early)\", \"cos_sim\", -0.031, -0.022, -0.018]\n          - [\"L0-L7 (early)\", \"mag_ratio\", 4.2, 6.8, 9.1]\n          - [\"L8-L19 (mid)\", \"cos_sim\", -0.072, -0.058, -0.041]\n          - [\"L8-L19 (mid)\", \"mag_ratio\", 6.9, 10.5, 13.8]\n          - [\"L20-L27 (late)\", \"cos_sim\", -0.048, -0.035, -0.027]\n          - [\"L20-L27 (late)\", \"mag_ratio\", 18.3, 52.4, 147.6]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: 28-layer heatmap of cos_sim across 3 epochs，蓝色(冲突)→白色(正交)→红色(一致)。中间层持续深蓝，浅层逐渐褪色。\"\n      - \"Fig B: mag_ratio 的 log-scale 折线图 (3 epochs x 28 layers)，展示 NTP 压制的逐层加剧趋势，L20+ 呈指数上升。\"\n      - \"Fig C: GAR vs NTP 梯度范数的 epoch 演化对比，GAR 范数指数衰减而 NTP 范数线性衰减，两者剪刀差扩大。\"\n    analysis: >\n      三个 epoch 的梯度动力学揭示完整的 \"GAR 边缘化\" 过程：训练初期 67.9% 的层存在\n      NTP-GAR 方向冲突，GAR 梯度仍有足够幅度推动 gate 学习（v7 训练曲线 phase B 对应\n      此阶段）；但 GAR loss 一旦收敛（gs144+ phase C），其梯度范数下降 12x，而 NTP\n      梯度仅下降 6x，mag_ratio 持续攀升。方向冲突看似\"减弱\"实际是 GAR 信号消亡的假象。\n      这解释了 NF1 (gate turn conditioning 反转)：在 GAR 梯度消失后，NTP 梯度单独\n      控制 gate，将 gate 推向 1.0（identity），且晚期 turn 推力最强因为 NTP loss 在\n      长 context 下梯度更大。\n\n  - name: \"Attention Heatmap Visualization (4 models x 3 conversations x 28 layers)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      对 Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only 四个模型，选取 3 段代表性对话 (短/中/长 turn)，\n      可视化 28 层 attention 对 goal tokens 的权重分布。主要展示推理时 attention\n      pattern 的退化以及 gating 无法改变退化趋势。\n    expected_results:\n      # 定性观察总结\n      base_goal_attn_turn1_avg: 0.042\n      base_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.008\n      base_decay_pattern: \"monotonic decrease across all layers\"\n      tg_goal_attn_turn1_avg: 0.044         # 与 base 几乎无差异\n      tg_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.009         # gate 未能改善\n      tg_vs_base_max_diff_any_layer: 0.003   # 最大差异仅 0.3pp\n      ug_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.008\n      lora_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.009\n      # 层级模式\n      shallow_layers_0_7_attn_retention: 0.65   # 浅层保留较多 goal attention\n      deep_layers_20_27_attn_retention: 0.12    # 深层退化最严重\n      cross_model_pattern_correlation: 0.94     # 四个模型退化模式高度相关\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 attention heatmap 的核心发现是：推理时四个模型的 attention\n      pattern 高度相似 (r=0.94)，证明 gating 在推理时未实质改变 attention 分布。\n      这与 NF3 (gate attenuation 仅 2-7%) 一致——gate 值过接近 1.0，residual\n      stream 的修改量不足以改变下游 attention。浅层保留较多 goal attention (65%\n      retention) 因为 positional bias 在浅层弱，深层 (L20-L27) 退化至 12%\n      retention 因为这些层负责 long-range dependency 但受 recency bias 影响最大。\n      Heatmap 本身是定性可视化，主要服务于论文 Fig 1 (problem illustration) 和\n      Analysis section 的直觉解释。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1: 4x3 grid heatmap (rows=models, cols=conversations)，每个 cell 是 28-layer x T-turn 的 goal attention 热力图。核心视觉效果：所有模型均呈现从左上(warm)到右下(cold)的对角衰减，四行几乎无法区分。\"\n      - \"Fig 2: Layer-wise goal attention retention curve (turn10/turn1 ratio)，4 条线几乎完全重叠，y 轴从浅层 0.65 下降到深层 0.12。\"\n      - \"Fig 3: TG vs Base attention difference map (28 layers x turns)，整个 map 在 ±0.003 范围内，颜色几乎全白，视觉上强调 gating 的无效性。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Attention heatmap 提供直觉层面的证据补充。关键可视化发现：(1) goal attention\n      退化是全局性的，跨所有层和模型一致；(2) TG vs Base 的 attention difference map\n      几乎全白（max diff 0.3pp），直接展示 gating 在推理时的无效性；(3) 深层退化\n      最严重与 Dongre 的 layer-wise probe 结果一致（probe AUC 在深层仍高但 attention\n      已关闭，信息在 residual stream 但无法通过 attention 访问）。这些可视化对\n      reviewer 说服力强于纯数字。\n\n  - name: \"Held-out Eval (50 convs, idx>=8000)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      从 UltraChat 完整集中抽取 idx>=8000 的 50 段对话构建真正 held-out eval set，\n      消除训练数据与评估数据重叠的 confound，重新运行 4-way eval。\n    expected_results:\n      # Base model on held-out\n      heldout_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0025       # 略低于 standard eval 的 0.003，held-out 数据无 overlap\n      heldout_base_ppl: 4.51                     # 略高于 standard 4.23，符合 held-out 预期\n      # ThreadGate on held-out\n      heldout_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.028           # 关键指标：高于 standard 的 0.0157\n      heldout_tg_dongre_turn1_gar: 0.072\n      heldout_tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.091             # held-out 上 ours 定义也显著低于 standard 的 0.487\n      heldout_tg_ppl: 2.78                       # 略高于 standard 2.63\n      heldout_tg_training_inference_gap_x: 17.1  # 0.48/0.028 ≈ 17x (vs standard 30x)\n      # Uniform Gate on held-out\n      heldout_ug_dongre_mid_gar: 0.024\n      heldout_ug_ppl: 2.76\n      # LoRA-only on held-out\n      heldout_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.026\n      heldout_lora_ppl: 2.79\n      # Key comparisons\n      heldout_tg_vs_lo_gar_diff_pp: 0.2          # 0.028 - 0.026 = 0.2pp，几乎无差异\n      heldout_gating_incremental_gar_pp: 0.4     # TG vs LO 差异极小，gating 仍无实质增量\n      heldout_training_inference_gap_x_range: \"17x\"\n      standard_vs_heldout_gap_ratio: 1.76        # standard 30x / held-out 17x，gap 缩小 ~43%\n      heldout_ours_inflation_factor: 5.3          # standard ours mid 0.487 / held-out ours mid 0.091\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 held-out eval gap 缩小到 10-20x 范围 (具体 17x)，主要原因是\n      standard eval set 与训练数据存在 overlap。训练时模型在相同或相似的 context 上\n      优化了 attention pattern，standard eval 复用这些 context 时，部分优化结果\n      \"泄漏\"到推理 GAR，导致 standard eval GAR (0.016) 人为偏低（实际 attention\n      pattern 在 seen context 上保留了微弱的训练痕迹）。Held-out data 消除此 overlap\n      后，推理 GAR 略升至 0.028（模型在全新 context 上的 attention pattern 更接近\n      其真实泛化能力），但 gap 仍然巨大 (17x)。ours 定义的 mid GAR 从 0.487 降至\n      0.091 是因为 ours 定义覆盖更多 goal tokens (system prompt + first user query)，\n      对 overlap 更敏感。PPL 略升 (~0.15) 符合 held-out 预期。关键结论不变：gating\n      无增量 (TG vs LO 差异 0.2pp)，training-inference gap 仍远超实用阈值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4-way eval comparison — Standard vs Held-out\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Standard Dongre GAR\", \"Held-out Dongre GAR\", \"Standard PPL\", \"Held-out PPL\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", 0.003, 0.0025, 4.23, 4.51]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 0.0157, 0.028, 2.63, 2.78]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", 0.013, 0.024, 2.62, 2.76]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 0.0137, 0.026, 2.63, 2.79]\n      - name: \"Table: Training-inference gap comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Eval Set\", \"Training GAR\", \"Inference GAR (Dongre)\", \"Gap (x)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Standard\", 0.48, 0.0157, \"30.6x\"]\n          - [\"Held-out\", 0.48, 0.028, \"17.1x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart 对比 standard vs held-out 的 4-way GAR，双柱并列。Held-out 整体略高但模式一致：TG≈UG≈LO >> Base，gating 无增量。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Held-out eval 的核心发现：(1) training-inference gap 从 30x 缩小到 17x，\n      表明 standard eval 存在 ~43% 的 overlap inflation；(2) 但 17x gap 仍远超\n      实用阈值（若 gating 有效，gap 应 <2x）；(3) gating 无增量的结论不受影响\n      (TG vs LO 差异 0.2pp)。论文需诚实报告此差异：\"30x gap observed on overlapping\n      eval narrows to 17x on held-out data, suggesting ~43% inflation from eval-train\n      overlap; nevertheless, a 17x gap remains far beyond practical utility (effective\n      gating would yield <2x).\" 这实际上加强了论文的方法论严谨性，但需将标题级 claim\n      从 \"30x\" 改为 \"10-30x depending on evaluation setting\"。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Phase 1 GAR Degradation Diagnosis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上复制 Phase 1 GAR 诊断流程，使用相同的 5 段对话 x 10 turns，\n      确认 GAR 衰减是否跨架构存在。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_turn1_avg_gar: 0.0312           # 低于 Qwen 的 0.0418\n      llama3_mid_turns_avg_gar: 0.0178       # 高于 Qwen 的 0.0122\n      llama3_relative_drop: 0.429            # 42.9% raw drop (vs Qwen 70.8%)\n      llama3_per_turn_avg_gar:\n        - 0.0312    # turn 1\n        - 0.0265    # turn 2\n        - 0.0231    # turn 3\n        - 0.0198    # turn 4\n        - 0.0185    # turn 5\n        - 0.0172    # turn 6\n        - 0.0163    # turn 7\n        - 0.0158    # turn 8\n        - 0.0149    # turn 9\n        - 0.0142    # turn 10\n      llama3_decay_curve_shape: \"gradual_monotonic\"   # 比 Qwen 更平缓，无急剧下降\n      llama3_vs_qwen_turn1_ratio: 0.746               # Llama turn1 GAR 约为 Qwen 的 75%\n      llama3_vs_qwen_mid_ratio: 1.459                 # Llama mid GAR 高于 Qwen 46%\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 Llama-3 GAR 衰减存在但幅度较弱 (raw drop 30-50% 范围内取 43%)。\n      Llama-3 使用 GQA (Grouped Query Attention) 而非 Qwen 的 standard MHA，GQA\n      的 KV 共享机制使得 attention head 之间 goal attention 分布更均匀，衰减更平缓。\n      此外 Llama-3 的 pretraining distribution 包含更多长对话数据 (RedPajama v2\n      含大量 multi-turn forum data)，可能使模型对长 context 下的 attention 分配更\n      鲁棒。Turn 1 GAR 较低 (0.031 vs 0.042) 可能因为 Llama-3 的 attention 分布\n      更分散 (GQA head 数少，每个 head 覆盖更广)，但衰减更慢使得 mid-turn GAR 反而\n      更高。衰减方向一致 (monotonic decrease) 确认了 GAR 退化是跨架构的结构性现象。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Phase 1 GAR comparison — Qwen vs Llama\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Turn 1 GAR\", 0.0418, 0.0312]\n          - [\"Mid-turn GAR\", 0.0122, 0.0178]\n          - [\"Raw Drop\", \"70.8%\", \"42.9%\"]\n          - [\"Decay Shape\", \"steep early drop\", \"gradual monotonic\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双线折线图 (Qwen blue, Llama orange) 展示 10-turn GAR 衰减曲线。Qwen 陡峭下降后趋平，Llama 平缓单调下降。两线在 turn 3-4 交叉。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3 GAR 衰减方向与 Qwen 一致 (单调递减)，确认跨模型普遍性，但幅度\n      减弱约 40%。这对论文叙事有两面影响：(1) 正面——GAR 衰减是架构无关的结构性\n      现象；(2) 需处理——衰减幅度差异需解释（GQA vs MHA, pretraining distribution）。\n      论文应将此作为额外 insight：\"attention decay severity is architecture-dependent,\n      with GQA potentially providing partial mitigation through KV sharing\"。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate v7 Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上复制 ThreadGate v7 训练 (MSE+gate_div loss)，验证\n      training-inference gap 是否跨模型存在。需适配 Llama 架构 (32 layers, GQA)。\n    expected_results:\n      # 训练指标\n      llama3_tg_training_gar_final: 0.32         # 低于 Qwen 的 0.48\n      llama3_tg_final_avg_ntp: 0.912\n      llama3_tg_final_avg_gar_loss: 0.003\n      llama3_tg_final_avg_div: 0.0001\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_mean: 0.951\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_std: 0.038\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_min: 0.832\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_max: 0.993\n      llama3_tg_training_time_hours: 6.8\n      # GAR 收敛动力学\n      llama3_gar_convergence_phase: \"A(gs0-120):plateau@0.015 B(gs120-220):gradual_rise C(gs220+):partial_converge@0.32\"\n      llama3_gar_plateau_longer: true             # 比 Qwen 更长的 plateau phase\n      llama3_gar_final_lower_than_qwen: true\n      # 推理评估\n      llama3_tg_eval_dongre_mid_gar: 0.033        # 推理 GAR\n      llama3_tg_eval_dongre_turn1_gar: 0.068\n      llama3_tg_eval_ours_mid_gar: 0.044\n      llama3_tg_training_inference_gap_x: 9.7     # 0.32/0.033 ≈ 9.7x (vs Qwen 30x)\n      llama3_tg_ppl: 2.81\n      # Gate profile\n      llama3_tg_gate_direction: \"WRONG but weaker\"\n      llama3_tg_gate_diff_wrong_layers: 24        # 24/32 层反向 (vs Qwen 27/28)\n      llama3_tg_gate_max_attenuation_diff: -0.14  # vs Qwen -0.21\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 Llama-3 training GAR 收敛较低 (0.32 vs Qwen 0.48)，原因：\n      (1) Llama-3 GQA 架构中 KV head 共享使得 gate 对 attention 的影响路径更间接——\n      gate 调制 residual stream 后需通过 fewer KV heads 影响 attention，每个 KV head\n      服务多个 query head 导致 GAR optimization signal 被稀释；(2) Llama-3 32 层\n      (vs Qwen 28) 增加了优化空间但也增加了 GAR loss 信号传播的难度。Training-inference\n      gap 为 9.7x (在 5-15x 范围内)，方向与 Qwen 一致但绝对值较小，部分因为 training\n      GAR 本身较低 (0.32 vs 0.48)，部分因为 Llama 推理 GAR base 较高 (0.033 vs 0.016)。\n      Gate turn conditioning 仍然反向 (24/32 层) 但动态范围更窄 (max diff -0.14 vs -0.21)，\n      与 gate_mean 更接近 1.0 一致。训练时间略长 (6.8h vs 5.9h) 因为 Llama 32 层。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: ThreadGate training comparison — Qwen vs Llama\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Training GAR (final)\", 0.48, 0.32]\n          - [\"Inference GAR (Dongre)\", 0.0157, 0.033]\n          - [\"Training-Inference Gap\", \"30.6x\", \"9.7x\"]\n          - [\"Gate Mean\", 0.934, 0.951]\n          - [\"Wrong-direction Layers\", \"27/28\", \"24/32\"]\n          - [\"Max Gate Diff\", -0.21, -0.14]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 训练 GAR 曲线对比 (Qwen blue, Llama orange)。Qwen 在 gs75 急升并在 gs144 饱和于 0.48；Llama 在 gs120 缓升，gs220 后渐近 0.32，未完全收敛。\"\n      - \"Fig: 推理时 gate profile 对比 (per-layer gate_mean at turn1 vs turn21)。两模型均呈反向 conditioning 但 Llama 差异更小。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3 复现了 training-inference gap 的核心模式但效应减弱 (9.7x vs 30x)。\n      论文需讨论两个层面：(1) gap 方向一致确认 distribution shift 是结构性的；\n      (2) 幅度差异可归因于 GQA (attention pattern 对 residual stream 修改的敏感度\n      不同) 和 pretraining distribution (Llama 对长 context 更鲁棒)。Gate 反向\n      turn conditioning 在 Llama 上也存在 (24/32 层) 但弱于 Qwen (27/28)。这支持\n      \"consistent failure direction with architecture-dependent magnitude\" 的叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 上 LoRA-only 训练 (gate fixed at 1.0)，作为 gating 消融对照。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_lora_epochs_completed: 3\n      llama3_lora_global_steps: 3200           # Llama 32 层 LoRA params 略多\n      llama3_lora_training_time_hours: 6.5\n      llama3_lora_final_lora_size_mb: 22\n      llama3_lora_final_ntp: 0.908\n    result_rationale: >\n      LoRA-only 训练是标准流程，预期无意外。训练时间和步数略多于 Qwen (6.5h vs 5.7h)\n      因为 Llama 32 层 (vs 28) 增加了约 14% 的 LoRA 参数量。NTP loss 收敛到 0.908\n      略低于 Qwen 的 0.948（Llama 在 UltraChat 上可能学得稍好因为 pretraining data\n      更接近 UltraChat 的对话分布）。此实验本身无独立发现，价值在于为 plan_012\n      3-way eval 提供 baseline。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      训练过程无意外，模型正常收敛。为 3-way eval 提供必要的 gating 消融 baseline。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B 3-way Eval (Base/TG/LoRA-only)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      在 held-out eval set 上对 Llama-3 三个模型 (Base/TG/LoRA-only) 进行 GAR + PPL\n      双指标评估。省略 UG (因 Qwen 已证明 UG≈TG，跨模型复制优先级低于 TG vs LO 对比)。\n    expected_results:\n      # Base\n      llama3_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0045          # Llama base GAR 高于 Qwen (0.0025 held-out)\n      llama3_base_ppl: 4.08                        # Llama base PPL 略低（pretraining 优势）\n      # ThreadGate\n      llama3_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.033              # 与 plan_010 推理结果一致\n      llama3_tg_ppl: 2.81\n      llama3_tg_recovery_pp: 2.85                  # (0.033 - 0.0045) / 0.01 * 1 ≈ 2.85pp\n      # LoRA-only\n      llama3_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.029\n      llama3_lora_ppl: 2.79\n      llama3_lora_recovery_pp: 2.45\n      # Key comparisons\n      llama3_tg_vs_lo_gar_diff_pp: 0.4             # 0.033 - 0.029 = 0.4pp，边缘差异\n      llama3_tg_vs_lo_ppl_diff: 0.02               # PPL 几乎无差异\n      llama3_gating_significant: false              # 差异不显著 (< 1pp)\n      llama3_gap_confirms_pattern: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 Llama-3 的 TG vs LO 差异为 0.4pp（在 -1.0 到 3.0 范围内取一个\n      非零但不显著的值）。这个微小正差意味着 ThreadGate 在 Llama 上可能有极微弱的\n      增量效果，但远未达到统计显著性。Reviewer 可能 latch onto 此差异质疑 \"是否在\n      Llama 上有更好配置\"（W2 风险略升），但论文可回应：(1) 0.4pp 差异在 GAR 测量\n      噪声范围内；(2) 即使取面值，9.7x training-inference gap 仍远超实用阈值；\n      (3) 跨模型 gating 均无实质增量是 converging evidence。PPL 差异 0.02 证明\n      gating 不影响语言建模质量，与 Qwen 结论一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3 3-way eval results\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Dongre Mid GAR\", \"Recovery (pp)\", \"PPL\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", 0.0045, \"—\", 4.08]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 0.033, 2.85, 2.81]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 0.029, 2.45, 2.79]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-model gating incremental comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen (held-out)\", \"Llama-3\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TG - LO GAR (pp)\", 0.2, 0.4]\n          - [\"TG - LO PPL\", 0.0, 0.02]\n          - [\"Gating significant?\", \"No\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双模型 3-way bar chart，左 Qwen 右 Llama，每组 3 bars (Base/TG/LO)。视觉强调：TG 和 LO bars 高度几乎相同，远低于 training GAR 虚线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3 3-way eval 确认 gating 无显著增量的跨模型一致性。TG vs LO 差异\n      0.4pp 虽然方向为正（在 Qwen 上为 0.2pp），但不具统计显著性。论文可\n      写：\"Across both architectures, ThreadGate provides no statistically significant\n      improvement over LoRA-only (Δ = 0.2–0.4pp, within measurement noise), confirming\n      that the gating mechanism itself is redundant.\" 注意 Llama 整体推理 GAR 更高\n      (0.033 vs Qwen 0.028) 与 Phase 1 发现一致（Llama base GAR 衰减更慢），\n      但 training-inference gap 仍达 9.7x，远超实用。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Gradient Conflict Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      对 Llama-3 TG v7 训练的 checkpoint 计算 NTP vs GAR 梯度 cos_sim 和 mag_ratio，\n      验证梯度竞争是否跨模型存在。P1 优先级——若时间不足可省略。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_grad_conflict_layer_pct: 0.594        # 59.4% 层冲突 (19/32)，低于 Qwen 67-79%\n      llama3_grad_mean_cos_sim_early: -0.052       # 方向冲突弱于 Qwen (-0.089)\n      llama3_grad_mean_cos_sim_late: -0.018        # 训练后期冲突更弱\n      llama3_grad_median_mag_ratio_early: 5.2\n      llama3_grad_median_mag_ratio_late: 6.8       # 低于 Qwen (14.7)，NTP 压制较轻\n      llama3_grad_L31_mag_ratio: 89.0              # 最后层仍极端但低于 Qwen L27 的 1139\n      llama3_grad_conflict_pattern: \"consistent_but_weaker\"\n      llama3_some_layers_aligned: true             # 部分层 cos_sim > 0（NTP 和 GAR 方向一致）\n      llama3_aligned_layers: [0, 1, 2, 28, 29, 30, 31]  # 首尾层较多一致\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 Llama-3 梯度冲突方向一致但 mag_ratio 较低，部分层甚至不冲突。\n      具体原因：(1) GQA 的 KV sharing 使得 gate 参数接收的 attention-related 梯度\n      被多个 query head 平均，减少了极端冲突；(2) Llama 32 层中首尾 7 层 cos_sim > 0\n      因为这些层的 NTP 和 GAR 目标在功能上更接近（浅层做 token embedding refinement，\n      深层做 next-token prediction，两者对 gate 的需求方向相似）；(3) mag_ratio 6.8\n      (vs Qwen 14.7) 反映 Llama 上 GAR loss 信号相对更强（因为 training GAR 仅达\n      0.32 未完全收敛，GAR 梯度残余更大）。这解释了为什么 Llama gate 反向 conditioning\n      没 Qwen 严重 (24/32 vs 27/28)：部分层梯度一致意味着 gate 在这些层学到了\n      正确方向。论文中此发现支持 \"architecture-dependent magnitude\" 的结论。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gradient conflict comparison — Qwen vs Llama\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Conflict Layer %\", \"67-79%\", \"59.4%\"]\n          - [\"Mean cos_sim (early)\", -0.089, -0.052]\n          - [\"Mean cos_sim (late)\", -0.042, -0.018]\n          - [\"Median mag_ratio (late)\", 14.7, 6.8]\n          - [\"Last-layer mag_ratio\", 1139, 89]\n          - [\"Aligned layers\", \"1/28\", \"7/32\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双模型 per-layer cos_sim bar chart (Qwen 28 bars, Llama 32 bars)，负值蓝色正值红色。Qwen 几乎全蓝，Llama 首尾数层为红色。\"\n      - \"Fig: mag_ratio 的 log-scale 对比折线图，Qwen 更陡峭（尤其 L20+），Llama 更平缓。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3 梯度冲突数据为 median 档最关键的\"效应减弱\"证据。59.4% 冲突层 (vs\n      Qwen 67-79%) 和 mag_ratio 6.8 (vs 14.7) 表明 NTP-GAR 竞争在 Llama 上\n      较轻。部分层 (7/32) 甚至方向一致是重要发现——这可能解释为什么 Llama TG vs LO\n      有微弱正差 (0.4pp)：这些一致层的 gate 可能学到了微弱的正确调制。然而整体\n      仍以冲突为主 (59.4%)，且 training-inference gap 仍达 9.7x，证明梯度冲突\n      不是唯一失败原因——distribution shift (SP1) 才是根本。论文应写：\"While gradient\n      competition is milder in Llama-3 (59% conflicting vs 79% in Qwen), the\n      training-inference gap persists (9.7x), confirming that distribution shift\n      is the primary failure mechanism, with gradient competition as an amplifier\n      whose severity varies by architecture.\" 如此实验因架构适配需额外调试而未\n      完成（median 档允许），可在 Appendix 中标注并在 camera-ready 补充。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream Task Sanity Check\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      设计简单的 instruction retention task：在 system prompt 中设定一条具体格式\n      指令（如 \"always end response with [DONE]\"），观察 10 turns 内遵循率变化。\n      链接 GAR 与下游任务表现。P2 优先级。\n    expected_results:\n      # Base model\n      base_instruction_follow_turn1: 0.92         # Turn 1 几乎完美遵循\n      base_instruction_follow_turn5: 0.64         # 中间开始遗忘\n      base_instruction_follow_turn10: 0.38        # 晚期显著退化\n      base_follow_drop_pct: 58.7                  # 58.7% 下降\n      # ThreadGate\n      tg_instruction_follow_turn1: 0.90\n      tg_instruction_follow_turn5: 0.66\n      tg_instruction_follow_turn10: 0.40\n      tg_follow_drop_pct: 55.6\n      # LoRA-only\n      lora_instruction_follow_turn1: 0.90\n      lora_instruction_follow_turn5: 0.62\n      lora_instruction_follow_turn10: 0.36\n      lora_follow_drop_pct: 60.0\n      # GAR-task correlation\n      gar_follow_pearson_r: 0.78                  # 中强正相关\n      gar_follow_spearman_rho: 0.82\n      tg_vs_base_follow_diff_turn10: 0.02         # 几乎无差异\n      num_test_conversations: 20\n      num_instruction_types: 3                     # 3 种指令类型取平均\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 downstream task 结果确认 GAR 与任务表现的正相关 (r=0.78)，但\n      gating 对任务表现无改善 (TG vs Base turn10 差异仅 2pp)。Instruction following\n      rate 从 turn1 ~90% 衰减到 turn10 ~38% 的模式与 GAR 衰减曲线定性一致。\n      相关系数 0.78 而非 >0.9 因为 instruction following 受多因素影响（不仅\n      attention to goal，还有 instruction complexity, output length, topic drift），\n      GAR 只是其中一个 proxy。这足以回应 W3 (GAR 作为唯一代理指标)：GAR 与实际\n      任务表现中强相关，GAR 衰减对应真实的功能退化，非人工指标。但 gating 无法\n      改善此退化——与 GAR 指标上的结论一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instruction following rate across turns\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1\", \"Turn 5\", \"Turn 10\", \"Drop %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", 0.92, 0.64, 0.38, \"58.7%\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 0.90, 0.66, 0.40, \"55.6%\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 0.90, 0.62, 0.36, \"60.0%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: GAR-task correlation\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pearson r (GAR vs follow rate)\", 0.78]\n          - [\"Spearman ρ\", 0.82]\n          - [\"p-value\", \"<0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双 y 轴折线图——左轴 GAR (蓝)，右轴 instruction follow rate (红)，x 轴 turns。两线同步下降，定性验证 GAR 作为 proxy 的合理性。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Downstream task sanity check 达成两个目标：(1) 建立 GAR 与实际任务表现的\n      相关性 (r=0.78, p<0.001)，回应 W3；(2) 确认 gating 在下游任务上同样无\n      改善，与 GAR 指标结论一致。论文可写 1 段：\"To validate GAR as a proxy for\n      functional degradation, we measure instruction retention (a simple downstream\n      task) and find r=0.78 correlation with GAR across turns (p<0.001). Consistent\n      with GAR results, ThreadGate provides no significant improvement in instruction\n      retention (Turn 10: TG 40% vs Base 38%, Δ=2pp).\" P2 优先级——如时间紧张，\n      此实验可省略或放 Appendix，但有它能显著缓解 W3。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17967,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17967},"output_tokens":22,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c180130d-54f8-4b82-ad72-762224b8f1d7","uuid":"c675a0d1-19f8-40c0-9bfd-a03f865ce57b"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":259127,"duration_api_ms":260681,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心 distribution shift insight 成立但需调整定量 claims 强度。\"30x gap\" 改为\n  \"10-30x gap depending on model and evaluation setting\"。跨模型结论从 \"identical\n  failure pattern\" 软化为 \"consistent failure direction with architecture-dependent\n  magnitude\"。Llama-3 gap 较小可归因于 GQA 注意力结构差异和不同 pretraining distribution，\n  这本身可成为额外 insight。Held-out eval gap 缩小需诚实报告并讨论 eval contamination\n  影响，同时强调即使 10x gap 仍远超实用阈值。标题从 \"Cannot Fix\" 软化为 \"Largely Fails to Fix\"。\n  Findings 评估 3.0-3.5 仍可行。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Gradient Conflict Analysis (Qwen v7, 3 checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      对 v7 训练的 3 个 epoch checkpoint (ep0/ep1/ep2) 计算每层 gate 参数上\n      NTP 与 GAR 梯度的 cos_sim 和 magnitude ratio，量化梯度竞争随训练演化的趋势。\n    expected_results:\n      # Epoch 0 checkpoint (训练初期，GAR loss 仍有信号)\n      ep0_conflict_layer_pct: 0.679      # 67.9% 层方向冲突 (cos_sim < 0)\n      ep0_mean_cos_sim: -0.089           # 平均余弦相似度，强方向冲突\n      ep0_median_mag_ratio: 7.5          # NTP 梯度幅度是 GAR 的 7.5x\n      ep0_L27_mag_ratio: 135.0           # 最后层 NTP 压制极端\n      # Epoch 1 checkpoint (GAR 已收敛，梯度信号衰减)\n      ep1_conflict_layer_pct: 0.714      # 71.4% 层仍冲突\n      ep1_mean_cos_sim: -0.063           # 冲突减弱——不是因为调和，而是 GAR 信号边缘化\n      ep1_median_mag_ratio: 11.2         # 幅度压制加剧\n      ep1_L27_mag_ratio: 487.0\n      # Epoch 2 checkpoint (训练末期)\n      ep2_conflict_layer_pct: 0.786      # 78.6% 层冲突（更多层 GAR 信号消失后暴露底层冲突）\n      ep2_mean_cos_sim: -0.042           # 方向冲突减弱 ← GAR 梯度幅度趋近零\n      ep2_median_mag_ratio: 14.7         # NTP 完全压制\n      ep2_L27_mag_ratio: 1139.0\n      # 关键层分析\n      early_layers_0_7_avg_cos_sim: -0.031    # 浅层冲突较弱\n      mid_layers_8_19_avg_cos_sim: -0.072     # 中间层冲突最强\n      late_layers_20_27_avg_cos_sim: -0.048   # 深层冲突中等但 mag_ratio 极高\n      gate_grad_norm_gar_ep0: 0.0034\n      gate_grad_norm_gar_ep2: 0.00028         # GAR 梯度范数下降 12x\n      gate_grad_norm_ntp_ep0: 0.025\n      gate_grad_norm_ntp_ep2: 0.0041          # NTP 梯度也下降但幅度小得多\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下此实验结果与 paper_framing 中已引用数据一致。核心发现是方向冲突\n      (cos_sim < 0) 随训练减弱不是因为两个 loss 目标调和了，而是 GAR 梯度幅度趋近零\n      导致冲突 \"消失\"。mag_ratio 从 7.5x 增长到 14.7x 证实 NTP 逐步完全压制 GAR。\n      中间层 (L8-L19) 冲突最强因为这些层是 attention pattern 形成的关键区域，GAR loss\n      试图在此干预但被 NTP 压制。L27 的极端 mag_ratio (135→1139) 反映最后一层 NTP\n      梯度因 cross-entropy softmax 特性天然最强。这些数据为 SP2 (NTP-GAR 梯度竞争)\n      提供完整的逐层、跨 epoch 量化证据。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Per-layer gradient conflict across 3 epochs\"\n        columns: [\"Layer Group\", \"Metric\", \"Epoch 0\", \"Epoch 1\", \"Epoch 2\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0-L7 (early)\", \"cos_sim\", -0.031, -0.022, -0.018]\n          - [\"L0-L7 (early)\", \"mag_ratio\", 4.2, 6.8, 9.1]\n          - [\"L8-L19 (mid)\", \"cos_sim\", -0.072, -0.058, -0.041]\n          - [\"L8-L19 (mid)\", \"mag_ratio\", 6.9, 10.5, 13.8]\n          - [\"L20-L27 (late)\", \"cos_sim\", -0.048, -0.035, -0.027]\n          - [\"L20-L27 (late)\", \"mag_ratio\", 18.3, 52.4, 147.6]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig A: 28-layer heatmap of cos_sim across 3 epochs，蓝色(冲突)→白色(正交)→红色(一致)。中间层持续深蓝，浅层逐渐褪色。\"\n      - \"Fig B: mag_ratio 的 log-scale 折线图 (3 epochs x 28 layers)，展示 NTP 压制的逐层加剧趋势，L20+ 呈指数上升。\"\n      - \"Fig C: GAR vs NTP 梯度范数的 epoch 演化对比，GAR 范数指数衰减而 NTP 范数线性衰减，两者剪刀差扩大。\"\n    analysis: >\n      三个 epoch 的梯度动力学揭示完整的 \"GAR 边缘化\" 过程：训练初期 67.9% 的层存在\n      NTP-GAR 方向冲突，GAR 梯度仍有足够幅度推动 gate 学习（v7 训练曲线 phase B 对应\n      此阶段）；但 GAR loss 一旦收敛（gs144+ phase C），其梯度范数下降 12x，而 NTP\n      梯度仅下降 6x，mag_ratio 持续攀升。方向冲突看似\"减弱\"实际是 GAR 信号消亡的假象。\n      这解释了 NF1 (gate turn conditioning 反转)：在 GAR 梯度消失后，NTP 梯度单独\n      控制 gate，将 gate 推向 1.0（identity），且晚期 turn 推力最强因为 NTP loss 在\n      长 context 下梯度更大。\n\n  - name: \"Attention Heatmap Visualization (4 models x 3 conversations x 28 layers)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      对 Base/TG/UG/LoRA-only 四个模型，选取 3 段代表性对话 (短/中/长 turn)，\n      可视化 28 层 attention 对 goal tokens 的权重分布。主要展示推理时 attention\n      pattern 的退化以及 gating 无法改变退化趋势。\n    expected_results:\n      # 定性观察总结\n      base_goal_attn_turn1_avg: 0.042\n      base_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.008\n      base_decay_pattern: \"monotonic decrease across all layers\"\n      tg_goal_attn_turn1_avg: 0.044         # 与 base 几乎无差异\n      tg_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.009         # gate 未能改善\n      tg_vs_base_max_diff_any_layer: 0.003   # 最大差异仅 0.3pp\n      ug_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.008\n      lora_goal_attn_turn10_avg: 0.009\n      # 层级模式\n      shallow_layers_0_7_attn_retention: 0.65   # 浅层保留较多 goal attention\n      deep_layers_20_27_attn_retention: 0.12    # 深层退化最严重\n      cross_model_pattern_correlation: 0.94     # 四个模型退化模式高度相关\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 attention heatmap 的核心发现是：推理时四个模型的 attention\n      pattern 高度相似 (r=0.94)，证明 gating 在推理时未实质改变 attention 分布。\n      这与 NF3 (gate attenuation 仅 2-7%) 一致——gate 值过接近 1.0，residual\n      stream 的修改量不足以改变下游 attention。浅层保留较多 goal attention (65%\n      retention) 因为 positional bias 在浅层弱，深层 (L20-L27) 退化至 12%\n      retention 因为这些层负责 long-range dependency 但受 recency bias 影响最大。\n      Heatmap 本身是定性可视化，主要服务于论文 Fig 1 (problem illustration) 和\n      Analysis section 的直觉解释。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 1: 4x3 grid heatmap (rows=models, cols=conversations)，每个 cell 是 28-layer x T-turn 的 goal attention 热力图。核心视觉效果：所有模型均呈现从左上(warm)到右下(cold)的对角衰减，四行几乎无法区分。\"\n      - \"Fig 2: Layer-wise goal attention retention curve (turn10/turn1 ratio)，4 条线几乎完全重叠，y 轴从浅层 0.65 下降到深层 0.12。\"\n      - \"Fig 3: TG vs Base attention difference map (28 layers x turns)，整个 map 在 ±0.003 范围内，颜色几乎全白，视觉上强调 gating 的无效性。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Attention heatmap 提供直觉层面的证据补充。关键可视化发现：(1) goal attention\n      退化是全局性的，跨所有层和模型一致；(2) TG vs Base 的 attention difference map\n      几乎全白（max diff 0.3pp），直接展示 gating 在推理时的无效性；(3) 深层退化\n      最严重与 Dongre 的 layer-wise probe 结果一致（probe AUC 在深层仍高但 attention\n      已关闭，信息在 residual stream 但无法通过 attention 访问）。这些可视化对\n      reviewer 说服力强于纯数字。\n\n  - name: \"Held-out Eval (50 convs, idx>=8000)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      从 UltraChat 完整集中抽取 idx>=8000 的 50 段对话构建真正 held-out eval set，\n      消除训练数据与评估数据重叠的 confound，重新运行 4-way eval。\n    expected_results:\n      # Base model on held-out\n      heldout_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0025       # 略低于 standard eval 的 0.003，held-out 数据无 overlap\n      heldout_base_ppl: 4.51                     # 略高于 standard 4.23，符合 held-out 预期\n      # ThreadGate on held-out\n      heldout_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.028           # 关键指标：高于 standard 的 0.0157\n      heldout_tg_dongre_turn1_gar: 0.072\n      heldout_tg_ours_mid_gar: 0.091             # held-out 上 ours 定义也显著低于 standard 的 0.487\n      heldout_tg_ppl: 2.78                       # 略高于 standard 2.63\n      heldout_tg_training_inference_gap_x: 17.1  # 0.48/0.028 ≈ 17x (vs standard 30x)\n      # Uniform Gate on held-out\n      heldout_ug_dongre_mid_gar: 0.024\n      heldout_ug_ppl: 2.76\n      # LoRA-only on held-out\n      heldout_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.026\n      heldout_lora_ppl: 2.79\n      # Key comparisons\n      heldout_tg_vs_lo_gar_diff_pp: 0.2          # 0.028 - 0.026 = 0.2pp，几乎无差异\n      heldout_gating_incremental_gar_pp: 0.4     # TG vs LO 差异极小，gating 仍无实质增量\n      heldout_training_inference_gap_x_range: \"17x\"\n      standard_vs_heldout_gap_ratio: 1.76        # standard 30x / held-out 17x，gap 缩小 ~43%\n      heldout_ours_inflation_factor: 5.3          # standard ours mid 0.487 / held-out ours mid 0.091\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 held-out eval gap 缩小到 10-20x 范围 (具体 17x)，主要原因是\n      standard eval set 与训练数据存在 overlap。训练时模型在相同或相似的 context 上\n      优化了 attention pattern，standard eval 复用这些 context 时，部分优化结果\n      \"泄漏\"到推理 GAR，导致 standard eval GAR (0.016) 人为偏低（实际 attention\n      pattern 在 seen context 上保留了微弱的训练痕迹）。Held-out data 消除此 overlap\n      后，推理 GAR 略升至 0.028（模型在全新 context 上的 attention pattern 更接近\n      其真实泛化能力），但 gap 仍然巨大 (17x)。ours 定义的 mid GAR 从 0.487 降至\n      0.091 是因为 ours 定义覆盖更多 goal tokens (system prompt + first user query)，\n      对 overlap 更敏感。PPL 略升 (~0.15) 符合 held-out 预期。关键结论不变：gating\n      无增量 (TG vs LO 差异 0.2pp)，training-inference gap 仍远超实用阈值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4-way eval comparison — Standard vs Held-out\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Standard Dongre GAR\", \"Held-out Dongre GAR\", \"Standard PPL\", \"Held-out PPL\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", 0.003, 0.0025, 4.23, 4.51]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 0.0157, 0.028, 2.63, 2.78]\n          - [\"Uniform Gate\", 0.013, 0.024, 2.62, 2.76]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 0.0137, 0.026, 2.63, 2.79]\n      - name: \"Table: Training-inference gap comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Eval Set\", \"Training GAR\", \"Inference GAR (Dongre)\", \"Gap (x)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Standard\", 0.48, 0.0157, \"30.6x\"]\n          - [\"Held-out\", 0.48, 0.028, \"17.1x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart 对比 standard vs held-out 的 4-way GAR，双柱并列。Held-out 整体略高但模式一致：TG≈UG≈LO >> Base，gating 无增量。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Held-out eval 的核心发现：(1) training-inference gap 从 30x 缩小到 17x，\n      表明 standard eval 存在 ~43% 的 overlap inflation；(2) 但 17x gap 仍远超\n      实用阈值（若 gating 有效，gap 应 <2x）；(3) gating 无增量的结论不受影响\n      (TG vs LO 差异 0.2pp)。论文需诚实报告此差异：\"30x gap observed on overlapping\n      eval narrows to 17x on held-out data, suggesting ~43% inflation from eval-train\n      overlap; nevertheless, a 17x gap remains far beyond practical utility (effective\n      gating would yield <2x).\" 这实际上加强了论文的方法论严谨性，但需将标题级 claim\n      从 \"30x\" 改为 \"10-30x depending on evaluation setting\"。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Phase 1 GAR Degradation Diagnosis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上复制 Phase 1 GAR 诊断流程，使用相同的 5 段对话 x 10 turns，\n      确认 GAR 衰减是否跨架构存在。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_turn1_avg_gar: 0.0312           # 低于 Qwen 的 0.0418\n      llama3_mid_turns_avg_gar: 0.0178       # 高于 Qwen 的 0.0122\n      llama3_relative_drop: 0.429            # 42.9% raw drop (vs Qwen 70.8%)\n      llama3_per_turn_avg_gar:\n        - 0.0312    # turn 1\n        - 0.0265    # turn 2\n        - 0.0231    # turn 3\n        - 0.0198    # turn 4\n        - 0.0185    # turn 5\n        - 0.0172    # turn 6\n        - 0.0163    # turn 7\n        - 0.0158    # turn 8\n        - 0.0149    # turn 9\n        - 0.0142    # turn 10\n      llama3_decay_curve_shape: \"gradual_monotonic\"   # 比 Qwen 更平缓，无急剧下降\n      llama3_vs_qwen_turn1_ratio: 0.746               # Llama turn1 GAR 约为 Qwen 的 75%\n      llama3_vs_qwen_mid_ratio: 1.459                 # Llama mid GAR 高于 Qwen 46%\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 Llama-3 GAR 衰减存在但幅度较弱 (raw drop 30-50% 范围内取 43%)。\n      Llama-3 使用 GQA (Grouped Query Attention) 而非 Qwen 的 standard MHA，GQA\n      的 KV 共享机制使得 attention head 之间 goal attention 分布更均匀，衰减更平缓。\n      此外 Llama-3 的 pretraining distribution 包含更多长对话数据 (RedPajama v2\n      含大量 multi-turn forum data)，可能使模型对长 context 下的 attention 分配更\n      鲁棒。Turn 1 GAR 较低 (0.031 vs 0.042) 可能因为 Llama-3 的 attention 分布\n      更分散 (GQA head 数少，每个 head 覆盖更广)，但衰减更慢使得 mid-turn GAR 反而\n      更高。衰减方向一致 (monotonic decrease) 确认了 GAR 退化是跨架构的结构性现象。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Phase 1 GAR comparison — Qwen vs Llama\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Turn 1 GAR\", 0.0418, 0.0312]\n          - [\"Mid-turn GAR\", 0.0122, 0.0178]\n          - [\"Raw Drop\", \"70.8%\", \"42.9%\"]\n          - [\"Decay Shape\", \"steep early drop\", \"gradual monotonic\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双线折线图 (Qwen blue, Llama orange) 展示 10-turn GAR 衰减曲线。Qwen 陡峭下降后趋平，Llama 平缓单调下降。两线在 turn 3-4 交叉。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3 GAR 衰减方向与 Qwen 一致 (单调递减)，确认跨模型普遍性，但幅度\n      减弱约 40%。这对论文叙事有两面影响：(1) 正面——GAR 衰减是架构无关的结构性\n      现象；(2) 需处理——衰减幅度差异需解释（GQA vs MHA, pretraining distribution）。\n      论文应将此作为额外 insight：\"attention decay severity is architecture-dependent,\n      with GQA potentially providing partial mitigation through KV sharing\"。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B ThreadGate v7 Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      在 Llama-3.1-8B 上复制 ThreadGate v7 训练 (MSE+gate_div loss)，验证\n      training-inference gap 是否跨模型存在。需适配 Llama 架构 (32 layers, GQA)。\n    expected_results:\n      # 训练指标\n      llama3_tg_training_gar_final: 0.32         # 低于 Qwen 的 0.48\n      llama3_tg_final_avg_ntp: 0.912\n      llama3_tg_final_avg_gar_loss: 0.003\n      llama3_tg_final_avg_div: 0.0001\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_mean: 0.951\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_std: 0.038\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_min: 0.832\n      llama3_tg_final_gate_max: 0.993\n      llama3_tg_training_time_hours: 6.8\n      # GAR 收敛动力学\n      llama3_gar_convergence_phase: \"A(gs0-120):plateau@0.015 B(gs120-220):gradual_rise C(gs220+):partial_converge@0.32\"\n      llama3_gar_plateau_longer: true             # 比 Qwen 更长的 plateau phase\n      llama3_gar_final_lower_than_qwen: true\n      # 推理评估\n      llama3_tg_eval_dongre_mid_gar: 0.033        # 推理 GAR\n      llama3_tg_eval_dongre_turn1_gar: 0.068\n      llama3_tg_eval_ours_mid_gar: 0.044\n      llama3_tg_training_inference_gap_x: 9.7     # 0.32/0.033 ≈ 9.7x (vs Qwen 30x)\n      llama3_tg_ppl: 2.81\n      # Gate profile\n      llama3_tg_gate_direction: \"WRONG but weaker\"\n      llama3_tg_gate_diff_wrong_layers: 24        # 24/32 层反向 (vs Qwen 27/28)\n      llama3_tg_gate_max_attenuation_diff: -0.14  # vs Qwen -0.21\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 Llama-3 training GAR 收敛较低 (0.32 vs Qwen 0.48)，原因：\n      (1) Llama-3 GQA 架构中 KV head 共享使得 gate 对 attention 的影响路径更间接——\n      gate 调制 residual stream 后需通过 fewer KV heads 影响 attention，每个 KV head\n      服务多个 query head 导致 GAR optimization signal 被稀释；(2) Llama-3 32 层\n      (vs Qwen 28) 增加了优化空间但也增加了 GAR loss 信号传播的难度。Training-inference\n      gap 为 9.7x (在 5-15x 范围内)，方向与 Qwen 一致但绝对值较小，部分因为 training\n      GAR 本身较低 (0.32 vs 0.48)，部分因为 Llama 推理 GAR base 较高 (0.033 vs 0.016)。\n      Gate turn conditioning 仍然反向 (24/32 层) 但动态范围更窄 (max diff -0.14 vs -0.21)，\n      与 gate_mean 更接近 1.0 一致。训练时间略长 (6.8h vs 5.9h) 因为 Llama 32 层。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: ThreadGate training comparison — Qwen vs Llama\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Training GAR (final)\", 0.48, 0.32]\n          - [\"Inference GAR (Dongre)\", 0.0157, 0.033]\n          - [\"Training-Inference Gap\", \"30.6x\", \"9.7x\"]\n          - [\"Gate Mean\", 0.934, 0.951]\n          - [\"Wrong-direction Layers\", \"27/28\", \"24/32\"]\n          - [\"Max Gate Diff\", -0.21, -0.14]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 训练 GAR 曲线对比 (Qwen blue, Llama orange)。Qwen 在 gs75 急升并在 gs144 饱和于 0.48；Llama 在 gs120 缓升，gs220 后渐近 0.32，未完全收敛。\"\n      - \"Fig: 推理时 gate profile 对比 (per-layer gate_mean at turn1 vs turn21)。两模型均呈反向 conditioning 但 Llama 差异更小。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3 复现了 training-inference gap 的核心模式但效应减弱 (9.7x vs 30x)。\n      论文需讨论两个层面：(1) gap 方向一致确认 distribution shift 是结构性的；\n      (2) 幅度差异可归因于 GQA (attention pattern 对 residual stream 修改的敏感度\n      不同) 和 pretraining distribution (Llama 对长 context 更鲁棒)。Gate 反向\n      turn conditioning 在 Llama 上也存在 (24/32 层) 但弱于 Qwen (27/28)。这支持\n      \"consistent failure direction with architecture-dependent magnitude\" 的叙事。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B LoRA-only Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      Llama-3.1-8B 上 LoRA-only 训练 (gate fixed at 1.0)，作为 gating 消融对照。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_lora_epochs_completed: 3\n      llama3_lora_global_steps: 3200           # Llama 32 层 LoRA params 略多\n      llama3_lora_training_time_hours: 6.5\n      llama3_lora_final_lora_size_mb: 22\n      llama3_lora_final_ntp: 0.908\n    result_rationale: >\n      LoRA-only 训练是标准流程，预期无意外。训练时间和步数略多于 Qwen (6.5h vs 5.7h)\n      因为 Llama 32 层 (vs 28) 增加了约 14% 的 LoRA 参数量。NTP loss 收敛到 0.908\n      略低于 Qwen 的 0.948（Llama 在 UltraChat 上可能学得稍好因为 pretraining data\n      更接近 UltraChat 的对话分布）。此实验本身无独立发现，价值在于为 plan_012\n      3-way eval 提供 baseline。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      训练过程无意外，模型正常收敛。为 3-way eval 提供必要的 gating 消融 baseline。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B 3-way Eval (Base/TG/LoRA-only)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      在 held-out eval set 上对 Llama-3 三个模型 (Base/TG/LoRA-only) 进行 GAR + PPL\n      双指标评估。省略 UG (因 Qwen 已证明 UG≈TG，跨模型复制优先级低于 TG vs LO 对比)。\n    expected_results:\n      # Base\n      llama3_base_dongre_mid_gar: 0.0045          # Llama base GAR 高于 Qwen (0.0025 held-out)\n      llama3_base_ppl: 4.08                        # Llama base PPL 略低（pretraining 优势）\n      # ThreadGate\n      llama3_tg_dongre_mid_gar: 0.033              # 与 plan_010 推理结果一致\n      llama3_tg_ppl: 2.81\n      llama3_tg_recovery_pp: 2.85                  # (0.033 - 0.0045) / 0.01 * 1 ≈ 2.85pp\n      # LoRA-only\n      llama3_lora_dongre_mid_gar: 0.029\n      llama3_lora_ppl: 2.79\n      llama3_lora_recovery_pp: 2.45\n      # Key comparisons\n      llama3_tg_vs_lo_gar_diff_pp: 0.4             # 0.033 - 0.029 = 0.4pp，边缘差异\n      llama3_tg_vs_lo_ppl_diff: 0.02               # PPL 几乎无差异\n      llama3_gating_significant: false              # 差异不显著 (< 1pp)\n      llama3_gap_confirms_pattern: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 Llama-3 的 TG vs LO 差异为 0.4pp（在 -1.0 到 3.0 范围内取一个\n      非零但不显著的值）。这个微小正差意味着 ThreadGate 在 Llama 上可能有极微弱的\n      增量效果，但远未达到统计显著性。Reviewer 可能 latch onto 此差异质疑 \"是否在\n      Llama 上有更好配置\"（W2 风险略升），但论文可回应：(1) 0.4pp 差异在 GAR 测量\n      噪声范围内；(2) 即使取面值，9.7x training-inference gap 仍远超实用阈值；\n      (3) 跨模型 gating 均无实质增量是 converging evidence。PPL 差异 0.02 证明\n      gating 不影响语言建模质量，与 Qwen 结论一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Llama-3 3-way eval results\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Dongre Mid GAR\", \"Recovery (pp)\", \"PPL\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", 0.0045, \"—\", 4.08]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 0.033, 2.85, 2.81]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 0.029, 2.45, 2.79]\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-model gating incremental comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen (held-out)\", \"Llama-3\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TG - LO GAR (pp)\", 0.2, 0.4]\n          - [\"TG - LO PPL\", 0.0, 0.02]\n          - [\"Gating significant?\", \"No\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双模型 3-way bar chart，左 Qwen 右 Llama，每组 3 bars (Base/TG/LO)。视觉强调：TG 和 LO bars 高度几乎相同，远低于 training GAR 虚线。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3 3-way eval 确认 gating 无显著增量的跨模型一致性。TG vs LO 差异\n      0.4pp 虽然方向为正（在 Qwen 上为 0.2pp），但不具统计显著性。论文可\n      写：\"Across both architectures, ThreadGate provides no statistically significant\n      improvement over LoRA-only (Δ = 0.2–0.4pp, within measurement noise), confirming\n      that the gating mechanism itself is redundant.\" 注意 Llama 整体推理 GAR 更高\n      (0.033 vs Qwen 0.028) 与 Phase 1 发现一致（Llama base GAR 衰减更慢），\n      但 training-inference gap 仍达 9.7x，远超实用。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.1-8B Gradient Conflict Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      对 Llama-3 TG v7 训练的 checkpoint 计算 NTP vs GAR 梯度 cos_sim 和 mag_ratio，\n      验证梯度竞争是否跨模型存在。P1 优先级——若时间不足可省略。\n    expected_results:\n      llama3_grad_conflict_layer_pct: 0.594        # 59.4% 层冲突 (19/32)，低于 Qwen 67-79%\n      llama3_grad_mean_cos_sim_early: -0.052       # 方向冲突弱于 Qwen (-0.089)\n      llama3_grad_mean_cos_sim_late: -0.018        # 训练后期冲突更弱\n      llama3_grad_median_mag_ratio_early: 5.2\n      llama3_grad_median_mag_ratio_late: 6.8       # 低于 Qwen (14.7)，NTP 压制较轻\n      llama3_grad_L31_mag_ratio: 89.0              # 最后层仍极端但低于 Qwen L27 的 1139\n      llama3_grad_conflict_pattern: \"consistent_but_weaker\"\n      llama3_some_layers_aligned: true             # 部分层 cos_sim > 0（NTP 和 GAR 方向一致）\n      llama3_aligned_layers: [0, 1, 2, 28, 29, 30, 31]  # 首尾层较多一致\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 Llama-3 梯度冲突方向一致但 mag_ratio 较低，部分层甚至不冲突。\n      具体原因：(1) GQA 的 KV sharing 使得 gate 参数接收的 attention-related 梯度\n      被多个 query head 平均，减少了极端冲突；(2) Llama 32 层中首尾 7 层 cos_sim > 0\n      因为这些层的 NTP 和 GAR 目标在功能上更接近（浅层做 token embedding refinement，\n      深层做 next-token prediction，两者对 gate 的需求方向相似）；(3) mag_ratio 6.8\n      (vs Qwen 14.7) 反映 Llama 上 GAR loss 信号相对更强（因为 training GAR 仅达\n      0.32 未完全收敛，GAR 梯度残余更大）。这解释了为什么 Llama gate 反向 conditioning\n      没 Qwen 严重 (24/32 vs 27/28)：部分层梯度一致意味着 gate 在这些层学到了\n      正确方向。论文中此发现支持 \"architecture-dependent magnitude\" 的结论。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Gradient conflict comparison — Qwen vs Llama\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Qwen-2.5-7B\", \"Llama-3.1-8B\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Conflict Layer %\", \"67-79%\", \"59.4%\"]\n          - [\"Mean cos_sim (early)\", -0.089, -0.052]\n          - [\"Mean cos_sim (late)\", -0.042, -0.018]\n          - [\"Median mag_ratio (late)\", 14.7, 6.8]\n          - [\"Last-layer mag_ratio\", 1139, 89]\n          - [\"Aligned layers\", \"1/28\", \"7/32\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双模型 per-layer cos_sim bar chart (Qwen 28 bars, Llama 32 bars)，负值蓝色正值红色。Qwen 几乎全蓝，Llama 首尾数层为红色。\"\n      - \"Fig: mag_ratio 的 log-scale 对比折线图，Qwen 更陡峭（尤其 L20+），Llama 更平缓。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama-3 梯度冲突数据为 median 档最关键的\"效应减弱\"证据。59.4% 冲突层 (vs\n      Qwen 67-79%) 和 mag_ratio 6.8 (vs 14.7) 表明 NTP-GAR 竞争在 Llama 上\n      较轻。部分层 (7/32) 甚至方向一致是重要发现——这可能解释为什么 Llama TG vs LO\n      有微弱正差 (0.4pp)：这些一致层的 gate 可能学到了微弱的正确调制。然而整体\n      仍以冲突为主 (59.4%)，且 training-inference gap 仍达 9.7x，证明梯度冲突\n      不是唯一失败原因——distribution shift (SP1) 才是根本。论文应写：\"While gradient\n      competition is milder in Llama-3 (59% conflicting vs 79% in Qwen), the\n      training-inference gap persists (9.7x), confirming that distribution shift\n      is the primary failure mechanism, with gradient competition as an amplifier\n      whose severity varies by architecture.\" 如此实验因架构适配需额外调试而未\n      完成（median 档允许），可在 Appendix 中标注并在 camera-ready 补充。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream Task Sanity Check\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      设计简单的 instruction retention task：在 system prompt 中设定一条具体格式\n      指令（如 \"always end response with [DONE]\"），观察 10 turns 内遵循率变化。\n      链接 GAR 与下游任务表现。P2 优先级。\n    expected_results:\n      # Base model\n      base_instruction_follow_turn1: 0.92         # Turn 1 几乎完美遵循\n      base_instruction_follow_turn5: 0.64         # 中间开始遗忘\n      base_instruction_follow_turn10: 0.38        # 晚期显著退化\n      base_follow_drop_pct: 58.7                  # 58.7% 下降\n      # ThreadGate\n      tg_instruction_follow_turn1: 0.90\n      tg_instruction_follow_turn5: 0.66\n      tg_instruction_follow_turn10: 0.40\n      tg_follow_drop_pct: 55.6\n      # LoRA-only\n      lora_instruction_follow_turn1: 0.90\n      lora_instruction_follow_turn5: 0.62\n      lora_instruction_follow_turn10: 0.36\n      lora_follow_drop_pct: 60.0\n      # GAR-task correlation\n      gar_follow_pearson_r: 0.78                  # 中强正相关\n      gar_follow_spearman_rho: 0.82\n      tg_vs_base_follow_diff_turn10: 0.02         # 几乎无差异\n      num_test_conversations: 20\n      num_instruction_types: 3                     # 3 种指令类型取平均\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档下 downstream task 结果确认 GAR 与任务表现的正相关 (r=0.78)，但\n      gating 对任务表现无改善 (TG vs Base turn10 差异仅 2pp)。Instruction following\n      rate 从 turn1 ~90% 衰减到 turn10 ~38% 的模式与 GAR 衰减曲线定性一致。\n      相关系数 0.78 而非 >0.9 因为 instruction following 受多因素影响（不仅\n      attention to goal，还有 instruction complexity, output length, topic drift），\n      GAR 只是其中一个 proxy。这足以回应 W3 (GAR 作为唯一代理指标)：GAR 与实际\n      任务表现中强相关，GAR 衰减对应真实的功能退化，非人工指标。但 gating 无法\n      改善此退化——与 GAR 指标上的结论一致。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Instruction following rate across turns\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Turn 1\", \"Turn 5\", \"Turn 10\", \"Drop %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Base\", 0.92, 0.64, 0.38, \"58.7%\"]\n          - [\"ThreadGate\", 0.90, 0.66, 0.40, \"55.6%\"]\n          - [\"LoRA-only\", 0.90, 0.62, 0.36, \"60.0%\"]\n      - name: \"Table: GAR-task correlation\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pearson r (GAR vs follow rate)\", 0.78]\n          - [\"Spearman ρ\", 0.82]\n          - [\"p-value\", \"<0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 双 y 轴折线图——左轴 GAR (蓝)，右轴 instruction follow rate (红)，x 轴 turns。两线同步下降，定性验证 GAR 作为 proxy 的合理性。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Downstream task sanity check 达成两个目标：(1) 建立 GAR 与实际任务表现的\n      相关性 (r=0.78, p<0.001)，回应 W3；(2) 确认 gating 在下游任务上同样无\n      改善，与 GAR 指标结论一致。论文可写 1 段：\"To validate GAR as a proxy for\n      functional degradation, we measure instruction retention (a simple downstream\n      task) and find r=0.78 correlation with GAR across turns (p<0.001). Consistent\n      with GAR results, ThreadGate provides no significant improvement in instruction\n      retention (Turn 10: TG 40% vs Base 38%, Δ=2pp).\" P2 优先级——如时间紧张，\n      此实验可省略或放 Appendix，但有它能显著缓解 W3。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"c180130d-54f8-4b82-ad72-762224b8f1d7","total_cost_usd":0.46555525,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17967,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"output_tokens":13396,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17967,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":13396,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17967,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17967},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":12518,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.012628,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":13396,"cacheR